related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-032\n- observed_method: Single 2025-26 playoff G1s, 4 games x 2 offenses; leverage-weighted gap between observed and recommended mix.\n- observed_verdict: descriptive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-008", "score": 0.144, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-008 | Study family SF-APPA-008: Audit of overnight LLM adaptation-analysis batch ('9/10 adaptation predicts winning')\n- observed_research_question: Audit of overnight LLM adaptation-analysis batch ('9/10 adaptation predicts winning')\n- auto_outcome_status: artifact\n- observed_hypothesis: The agent batch's findings (defensive adjustments, point costs, adaptation predicts series winners 9/10) are valid.\n- observed_result: 706 findings with n<5; list_h2h_games called 0 times; series winners LLM-inferred; MIA-BOS G7 score invented (BOS 100 vs graph 84); what_came_next skips a possession; point costs are LLM arithmetic.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: C_artifact (apparent effect produced by a construction, selection or labelling flaw)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Series winners never looked up (0/2073 calls); master '9/10' rule built from LLM inference on inference; low-n claims (e.g. 0.0 PPP on n=3).\n- observed_sample_and_power: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-009"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-032", "score": 0.117, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-032 | Study family SF-APPA-032: Execution conformance scoring ORL vs DET\n- observed_research_question: Execution conformance scoring ORL vs DET\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: Measure how closely each team executed the recommended opener.\n- observed_result: ORL avg leverage |d| 12.6pp, scores 86.3/87.4; DET 7.7pp, 82.3/92.3; DET matched opener #3.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:DRIFT_NONSTATIONARITY\n- observed_failure_evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_sample_and_power: 1 game\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPS-017\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF32\n- observed_method: One game, 2 offenses; leverage-weighted conformance scores.\n- observed_verdict: descriptive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: DET note says it 'nailed the high-leverage moves' while PULL_UP was +10.2pp over the recommendation.\n- auto_confidence: medium (0.65)"}], "n_results": 4}

